* T3 fixture: DEFINE DATA with REDEFINE block containing typed sub-fields and FILLER gap
* Exercises: scalar field, REDEFINE relationship, sub-fields with types, FILLER gap

DEFINE DATA
LOCAL
  1 #CUSTOMER-ID (A10)
  1 REDEFINE #CUSTOMER-ID
    2 #REGION (A2)
    2 #SEQ (N8)
    2 FILLER 3X
    2 #CODE (A3)
END DEFINE

END
